WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.100
A genuine desktop capture of the listening interface.
The fictional Danish narration is AI-generated.

00:01.100 --> 00:04.800
The story plays. The current word changes with the audio.

00:04.800 --> 00:06.800
A click on the waveform seeks to a later point.

00:06.800 --> 00:08.700
A mouse drag marks a phrase to repeat.

00:08.700 --> 00:17.900
The selected Danish phrase repeats:
“Koppen var tom, men under den lå et kort.”

00:17.900 --> 00:21.200
Looping is disabled. Playback reaches the region end and pauses.

00:21.200 --> 00:22.100
Clear removes the selected region.

00:22.100 --> 00:22.800
Zoom enlarges the waveform.

00:22.800 --> 00:24.200
Keyboard controls change speed, skip sentences and play or pause.
